          'This does not mean past lives are inaccessible. It means that accessing them requires a specific effort of inner work — a deliberate act of deepened attention that reaches below the threshold of ordinary waking memory. The methods for doing this are practical and gentle, and beginnings can be made without any particular preparation beyond sincere intention.',
