          'As this practice deepens and the capacity for vivid, non-identified inner recall develops, it can be extended: from today, to yesterday, to the week before, to early childhood. Some students, with patience and consistent practice, find that this retrospective vision continues to deepen naturally, eventually touching experiences that do not belong to the current lifetime — memories with a different quality, a different body, a different setting.',
